n rêve dans le béton armé, personne n'y croyait,","t":83.2,"e":86.2,"w":[["J'ai",83.2,83.34],["planté",83.38,83.68],["un",83.74,83.82],["rêve",83.88,84.02],["dans",84.06,84.16],["le",84.2,84.3],["béton",84.36,84.64],["armé",84.78,85.26],["personne",85.32,85.62],["n'y",85.64,85.74],["croyait",85.78,86.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd'hui il a des racines… même le bitume s'est incliné.","t":86.32,"e":90.36,"w":[["Aujourd'hui",86.32,86.82],["il",86.84,86.9],["a",86.96,87.02],["des",87.08,87.18],["racines",87.26,87.72],["même",88.8,88.96],["le",88.98,89.08],["bitume",89.14,89.42],["s'est",89.46,89.62],["incliné",89.66,90.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ra-ta-ta-ta, la Terre transpire, les glaciers chavirent, l'air s'étire,","t":91.1,"e":94.42,"w":[["Ra-ta-ta-ta",91.1,91.3],["la",91.84,91.96],["Terre",92.02,92.26],["transpire",92.34,92.78],["les",92.82,92.92],["glaciers",92.98,93.24],["chavirent",93.3,93.84],["l'air",93.9,94.02],["s'étire",94.08,94.42]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Les usines soupirent, la fumée respire, les puissants s'en tirent, nous on paie le pire,","t":94.46,"e":97.64,"w":[["Les",94.46,94.56],["usines",94.62,94.84],["soupirent",94.9,95.24],["la",95.28,95.34],["fumée",95.4,95.6],["respire",95.68,96],["les",96.04,96.12],["puissants",96.18,96.44],["s'en",96.52,96.72],["tirent",96.78,96.96],["nous",96.98,96.98],["on",97,97.08],["paie",97.14,97.24],["le",97.28,97.34],["pire",97.46,97.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils vendent l'avenir en bourse, la planète en sourdine,","t":97.66,"e":100.2,"w":[["Ils",97.66,97.74],["vendent",97.78,98.2],["l'avenir",98.26,98.56],["en",98.6,98.7],["bourse",98.78,99],["la",99.06,99.14],["planète",99.18,99.5],["en",99.54,99.62],["sourdine",99.7,100.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils ont mis l'océan en bouteille et nous revendent les ruines.","t":100.22,"e":103.06,"w":[["Ils",100.22,100.32],["ont",100.34,100.42],["mis",100.48,100.58],["l'océan",100.62,101.02],["en",101.04,101.2],["bouteille",101.28,101.62],["et",101.64,101.7],["nous",101.76,101.86],["revenden