uh…","t":159.45,"e":160.13,"w":[["Hmm-hmm",159.45,159.65],["ouh-ouh",159.93,160.13]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Le ciel brûle, la mer monte, mais on plie pas,","t":160.42,"e":162.8,"w":[["Le",160.42,160.5],["ciel",160.56,160.84],["brûle",160.9,161.06],["la",161.08,161.18],["mer",161.26,161.48],["monte",161.58,161.82],["mais",161.88,162],["on",162.06,162.14],["plie",162.2,162.44],["pas",162.54,162.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La rue nous a appris à danser sous l'orage, oh-oh-oh.","t":165.24,"e":169.34,"w":[["La",165.24,165.36],["rue",165.44,165.54],["nous",165.6,165.74],["a",165.8,165.84],["appris",165.94,166.2],["à",166.26,166.32],["danser",166.4,166.96],["sous",167.06,167.32],["l'orage",167.38,168.06],["oh-oh-oh",169.14,169.34]],"ok":0.9},{"text":"Si la Terre a de la fièvre, on sera son remède,","t":170.22,"e":172.9,"w":[["Si",170.22,170.3],["la",170.34,170.46],["Terre",170.54,170.7],["a",170.74,170.82],["de",170.88,170.96],["la",171,171.1],["fièvre",171.2,171.52],["on",171.62,171.76],["sera",171.84,172.1],["son",172.16,172.3],["remède",172.32,172.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Main dans la main, pas à pas, personne ne cède.","t":173.14,"e":175.44,"w":[["Main",173.14,173.4],["dans",173.46,173.56],["la",173.62,173.7],["main",173.78,174.02],["pas",174.1,174.24],["à",174.28,174.34],["pas",174.38,174.5],["personne",174.56,174.86],["ne",174.88,174.96],["cède",175.04,175.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On tient bon ! (La Meute !) On tient bon ! (La Meute !)","t":175.84,"e":178.32,"w":[["On",175.84,175.92],["tient",176,176.28],["bon",176.34,176.46],["La",176.5,176.6],["Meute",176.66,177.1],["On",177.14,177.22],["tient",177.3,177.56],["bon",177.62,177.74],["La",177.78,177.86],["Meute",177.92,178.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même quand la pluie déborde, même quand le soleil frappe fort !","t":178.38,"e":185.2,"w":[["Même",178.38,178.52],["quand",178.56,178.68],["la",178.72,178.84],["pluie",178.9,179.18],["déborde",179.24,180.42],["même",183.28,183.42],["quand",183.46,183.6],["le",183.64,183.72],["soleil",183.8,184.32],["frappe",184.4,184.68],["fort",184.76,185.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Hmm-hmm… ouh-ouh…","t":186.03,"e":187.07,"w":[["Hmm-hmm",186.03,186.23],["ouh-ouh",186.87,187.07]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Après la pluie… y a toujours un arbre qui pousse…","t":187.7,"e":190.44,"w":[["Après",187.7,187.94],["la",188,188.14],["pluie",188.22,188.6],["y",188.72,188.74],["a",188.76,188.8],["toujours",188.86,189.16],["un",189.24,189.38],["arbre",189.46,189.76],["qui",189.82,189.92],["pousse",190.02,190.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aouuu…","t":194.39,"e":194.59,"w":[["Aouuu",194.39,194.59]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Charles le bon on the beat…","t":198.34,"e":199.94,"w":[["Charles",198.34,198.86],["le",198.86,199.06],["bon",198.86,199.24],["on",199.28,199.38],["the",199.42,199.52],["beat",199.62,199.94]],"ok":0.83}]}